    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$209.19$",
      "worked": "$r=\\frac{0.03}{12}=0.0025$, $n=1.5\\times12=18$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}FV&=PV(1+r)^n\\\\FV&=200(1+0.0025)^{18}\\\\FV&\\approx\\$209.19\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
